{"title":"2021 OIM Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d0461fe8d09e9ec7b5fe6e81320800dfbaf0cb5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, a_3, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> be a sequence of positive integers and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2553c2dc4ee9978f740a4c14d5f90891f71721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1, b_2, b_3, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> be the sequence of real numbers given by\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/8/ce84c9832d5d0d9aacdb6c835f0bcd63bc83d774.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b_n=\\frac{a_1a_2,\\cdots a_n}{a_1+a_2+\\cdots + a_n}, \\text{ for } n \\ge 1.\\]\" width=\"272\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Show that if among every one million consecutive terms of the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/2/ff2553c2dc4ee9978f740a4c14d5f90891f71721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1, b_2, b_3, \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" /> there is at least one integer, then there is some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/f/97f29ef2ddbc15df44dc61987cefa60869940d75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_k &gt; 2021^{2021}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2021_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_OIM_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://olcoma.ac.cr/internacional/oim-2021/examenes\">https://olcoma.ac.cr/internacional/oim-2021/examenes</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017043532\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1159/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.535      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    6.535      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26154:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017043532 and revision id 207213. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}